        IF NOT (`enforcement has been delayed by the appeal`)
            THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "interest for such time as enforcement has been delayed by the appeal" -- no enforcement has been delayed, so there is no such time: a period the text fixes in its own words (fork F10)
