DECLARE `o 19 r 12(1) way of giving a decision` IS ONE OF
    `o 19 r 12(1)(a) orally at the conclusion of the hearing`
    `o 19 r 12(1)(a) orally at a subsequent date`
    `o 19 r 12(1)(b) in writing at the conclusion of the hearing`
    `o 19 r 12(1)(b) in writing at a subsequent date`
    `o 19 r 12(1) in another way`

-- src:2333 | 12. —(1) Without affecting paragraph (2), the appellate Court may give its decision in any appeal or application — ( a )
-- src:2334 | orally at the conclusion of the hearing of the appeal or application or at a subsequent date; or
